The client selection here is based on querying the user-furnished client IDs. The user is prompted to enter the EV client IDs required for the training and evaluation process when the FL process begins. The selected training clients undergo training and send the model updates to the central server. The aggregated updates from the global model are then sent to the clients that have been chosen.
